  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SharpVision.SyntaxHighlighting 1.6.0-beta.5 prerelease: version-aligned with the other SharpVision packages; no functional changes since 1.6.0-beta.2, in which CodeView selection started to take part in the application-wide single text selection introduced in SharpVision 1.6.0-beta.2: selecting in a CodeView collapses ranges held by other owners and vice versa. Since 1.6.0-beta.1 CodeView derives from the core ScrollableCompositeControlBase and uses the shared ProjectionSurface, scroll-bridge, PropertyChanged, attachment, and glyph-resolution seams introduced in SharpVision 1.6.0-beta.1, replacing its own CodeViewContent and hand-rolled copies; no public behavior change.",
